[i]Station Yard Inc.: luxury crewed Stations for discerning captains.[/i]

[img width=800]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PaulRouss3l/crew_stations/main/docs/assets/ship-view.png[/img]
[i]Pick a ship from your fleet, then build or upgrade a Station in each of its slots.[/i]

