[spoiler=AI use disclaimer]
Some or all assets and code in this mod were created using AI tools:
[list]
[li][b]Code:[/b] Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), through Claude Code. It wrote most of the Java code, the build and art tooling, and the design and API documentation.[/li]
[li][b]Code review:[/b] Claude was also used to review each milestone for bugs before release. No line of code reaches a release without a human review.[/li]
[li][b]Art:[/b] the ten Station illustrations, the Crew Stations hullmod icon and the banner at the top of this post were made with Z-Image Turbo (Alibaba's Tongyi Lab), an open image model run locally in ComfyUI; the banner starts from the vanilla Onslaught sprite.[/li]
[/list]
How it was made: I designed the mod (the Stations, the Shipyard rules, the screen and the balance) and directed every change. Each milestone was then played and tested in game by me, against a checklist, before it was merged. The full source and the design notes are public on GitHub.
[/spoiler]
